3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form with empty Description and Amount was blocked; the dialog remained open and native browser validation reported 'Please fill out this field.' for both the description and amount inputs (required attribute set), no transaction was created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid date range not rejected/explained\", \"actual\": \"Setting From=2024-12-20 and To=2024-12-01 (start after end) is silently accepted; the filter inputs keep the invalid values and the table just shows a generic 'No transactions found / Try adjusting your filters' message. No validation error or explanation that the date range itself is invalid is shown.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Transaction created without a category, no validation error shown\", \"actual\": \"Submitted Add Transaction form with Description='CS-23 test missing category', Amount=50, and no Category selected (left as 'Select category'). The transaction was created successfully and appears in the table with an empty category cell ('—'), and Total Expenses updated to include it. No error identified the missing category.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Deleting a category in use is allowed and leaves transactions with a blank category\", \"actual\": \"Deleted the 'Software' category which had 1 assigned transaction (tx-10, 'Software Subscription - Adobe CC'). The confirmation dialog even warns 'Transactions using this category will not be deleted' but does not block or require reassignment. After deletion, the transaction's category cell is blank ('—' shown for reference plus empty category cell), leaving it with no category at all.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Total Balance stat does not update when transactions change\", \"actual\": \"After adding a current-month $123.45 expense and then a current-month $10,000 income, Monthly Income ($0→$10,000), Monthly Expenses ($0→$123), Net Profit/Loss, and Recent Transactions all updated immediately and correctly, but the dashboard's 'Total Balance' stat remained fixed at $74,931 throughout, never reflecting the new transactions.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marked 'QA Test Large Income' ($10,000) as Tax Related via edit form. Transaction row's Tax column now shows ✓. Tax Summary for 2026 updated: Taxable Income $0.00→$10,000.00, Net $9,876.55, transaction count 1→2, and the transaction now appears in the tax-related transactions list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Categories page shows per-category transaction count and total. 'Sales Revenue' count went from 3 tx/$36,750 to 4 tx/$46,750 after adding a $10,000 income transaction in that category; 'Office Supplies' went from 2 tx/$1,046 to 3 tx/$1,169.45 after adding a $123.45 expense in that category.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked 'Print Report' on the Tax Summary page for year 2026; no console errors were raised and the page remained functional (0 errors, 8 warnings total in console after the action).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Transactions table displays Date, Description, Category, Reference, Amount, and Tax columns for every row (e.g. new row: Aug 25 2026 | QA Test Office Supplies Purchase | Office Supplies | REF-QA-001 | -$123.45 | ✓). Total Income (+$47,592.50) and Total Expenses (-$36,609.44) shown for the current result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Monthly Income, Monthly Expenses, Net Profit/Loss and Recent Activity on dashboard, and Reports page monthly totals for August 2026 (income $0→$10,000, expenses $0→$123.45, profit accordingly, and per-category breakdown) all accurately reflect the two new current-month transactions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Chart axis labels lack precision for small non-zero values\", \"actual\": \"After adding a $123.45 expense (current month, only non-zero value in the chart's 6-month window), the 'Income vs Expenses' chart's Y-axis shows all five gridline labels as '$0k' (texts: Mar/Apr/May/Jun/Jul/Aug, $0k,$0k,$0k,$0k,$0k), failing to distinguish the $123 value from zero.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
